===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|[[Ireland]], [[Irelond]], [[Irlond]], [[Irland]]}}, from {{inh|en|ang|Īrland}}. Perhaps also from {{der|en|mga|-}} {{m|ga|Éire}} + {{m|en|-land}}. Ultimately from {{der|en|sga|Ériu||Ireland}}. See {{m|en|Irish}}.

